<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia import price data release delayed.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia import price data release delayed.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Bureau of Statistics said the release of the Australian import price index for July had been delayed to September 19 from today.</p>
<p>The rescheduling was due to processing delays, the ABS said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
